        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.575,
            0.842,
            0.611
          ],
          "content": "**Use this to find what design appears at positions 99, 122, and 148. Ans:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.614,
            0.51,
            0.633
          ],
          "content": "1. Design C appears at position 99."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.637,
            0.522,
            0.655
          ],
          "content": "2. Design B appears at position 122."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.659,
            0.523,
            0.678
          ],
          "content": "3. Design A appears at position 148."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.704,
            0.24,
            0.722
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Page No. 99"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.736,
            0.678,
            0.755
          ],
          "content": "? **Will this always happen? How do you show this?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.759,
            0.745,
            0.778
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** Let’s build a similar 3×3 grid with a Centre number a."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.383,
            0.789,
            0.615,
            0.857
          ],
          "content": "|  | a -7 |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| a -1 | a | a + 1 |\n|  | a + 7 |  |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_32_table_32.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.873,
            0.34,
            0.89
          ],
          "content": "Here, the sum is"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.895,
            0.834,
            0.912
          ],
          "content": "$a-7+a-1+a+a+1+a+7=5a$ (5times the number in the Centre.)"
        },
